  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"[P]rinted in the autumn of 1991 on Strathmore Rhododendron. Caslon, Franklin Gothic and various other types were hand set, &amp; the book was printed on a Challenge letter press."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Four signatures (9 x 16 cm)--sewn on 2 tapes, into cardboard covers. Text letterpress-printed on p. [2] of cover; pop-up paper arrow and silver star and triangle glued to p. [3] of cover along with two single sewn signatures (35 x 75 mm) glued to spine-side of p. [3] of cover. Pages of central text are modified with punched holes, stamped images using metallic ink, pasted on strips, and a folded page with sewn on layer of vellum paper with saw-toothed black paper edge under which are loose paper geometric shapes. Title letterpress printed on front cover with spelling of title: Imaggingg.</subfield>
  </datafield>
